---

---

<div class="app-content welcome-app">
  <div class="terminal-heading">
    <span class="prompt">~/system $</span> login.sh
  </div>

  <div class="welcome-header">
    <pre
      class="ascii-art">
 ██╗    ██╗███████╗██╗      ██████╗ ██████╗ ███╗   ███╗███████╗
 ██║    ██║██╔════╝██║     ██╔════╝██╔═══██╗████╗ ████║██╔════╝
 ██║ █╗ ██║█████╗  ██║     ██║     ██║   ██║██╔████╔██║█████╗  
 ██║███╗██║██╔══╝  ██║     ██║     ██║   ██║██║╚██╔╝██║██╔══╝  
 ╚███╔███╔╝███████╗███████╗╚██████╗╚██████╔╝██║ ╚═╝ ██║███████╗
  ╚══╝╚══╝ ╚══════╝╚══════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚═╝     ╚═╝╚══════╝
    </pre>
  </div>

  <div class="welcome-messages">
    <div class="system-message">
      <span class="timestamp">[{new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}]</span>
      <span class="msg-success">✓</span> Access granted to PePoDev's Desktop
    </div>

    <div class="system-message">
      <span class="timestamp">[{new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}]</span>
      <span class="msg-info">ℹ</span> Initializing awesome portfolio...
    </div>

    <div class="system-message">
      <span class="timestamp">[{new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}]</span>
      <span class="msg-success">✓</span> Loading 100% organic, free-range code
    </div>

    <div class="system-message">
      <span class="timestamp">[{new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}]</span>
      <span class="msg-warning">⚠</span> Warning: May contain traces of caffeine and
      late-night commits
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <div class="quote-icon">💭</div>
      <div class="quote-text">
        <p class="quote-main">
          "Any sufficiently advanced technology is indistinguishable from
          magic."
        </p>
        <p class="quote-author">— Arthur C. Clarke</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <h3>System Status</h3>
    <div class="status-grid">
      <div class="status-item">
        <div class="status-label">Coffee Level</div>
        <div class="status-value">
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div
              class="progress-fill"
              style="width: 87%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b4513, #d2691e);"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <span>87%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="status-item">
        <div class="status-label">Code Quality</div>
        <div class="status-value">
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div
              class="progress-fill"
              style="width: 95%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e, #16a34a);"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <span>95%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="status-item">
        <div class="status-label">Bug Squashing</div>
        <div class="status-value">
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div
              class="progress-fill"
              style="width: 92%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <span>92%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="status-item">
        <div class="status-label">Meme Game</div>
        <div class="status-value">
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div
              class="progress-fill"
              style="width: 99%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #9333ea);"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <span>99%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="fun-facts">
      <h3>Did You Know?</h3>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>🚀 This portfolio runs on 100% renewable keyboard energy</li>
        <li>🎯 No rubber ducks were harmed in the making of this code</li>
        <li>☕ Powered by coffee, debugged by determination</li>
        <li>🔥 Kubernetes clusters tamed, chaos engineered responsibly</li>
        <li>💚 Open source contributor & DevOps enthusiast</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="terminal-prompt">
      <span class="prompt">~/explore $</span>
      <span class="cursor-blink">▊</span>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.9em; opacity: 0.7;">
        Hint: Click on the desktop icons to explore my work, projects, and
        experience!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .welcome-app {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  }

  .welcome-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ascii-art {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-size: 0.45rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5);
  }

  .welcome-messages {
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in;
  }

  .system-message {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timestamp {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .msg-success {
    color: var(--accent-green);
  }

  .msg-info {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .msg-warning {
    color: var(--accent-yellow);
  }

  .quote-box {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-green);
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .quote-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .quote-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .quote-main {
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .quote-author {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .status-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .status-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .status-label {
    font-weight: 500;
    min-width: 120px;
  }

  .status-value {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .progress-bar {
    flex: 1;
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .progress-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: width 1s ease-out;
  }

  .status-value span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    min-width: 40px;
  }

  .fun-facts {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .fact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .fact-list li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .fact-list li::before {
    content: "›";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .terminal-prompt {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cursor-blink {
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
    color: var(--accent-green);
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    0%,
    50% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    51%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
